# Env for the OPTIONAL parallel Robinhood Chain node (docker-compose service
# `orquestra-robinhood`, started with `docker compose --profile robinhood up -d`).
#
#   cp .env.robinhood.example .env.robinhood
#
# This file mirrors .env.example — see it for the full option reference. Only the
# robinhood-specific settings and the required secrets are spelled out here.
# NOTE: REPPO_NETWORK is pinned to `robinhood` in docker-compose.yml for this
# service; setting it here has no effect (deliberate guardrail).

# ── Wallet ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Same key as your Base node is fine — different chains, independent nonces.
# The wallet needs (a) a little ETH on Robinhood Chain for gas, and (b) the
# datanet's own token (e.g. WOOD, PAW) for access/publishing fees — there is
# no REPPO on this chain. The mint budget cap (mintReppoMax in the strategy
# config) denominates that fee token here: e.g. mintReppoMax=1500 on a WOOD
# datanet caps publishing spend at 1500 WOOD over the budget horizon.
REPPO_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ── RPC (required) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public endpoint below works; swap in a private one if you hit rate limits.
RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.chain.robinhood.com

# ── LLM ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Same providers as the Base node (.env.example → LLM section).
LLM_PROVIDER=
LLM_API_KEY=

# ── Dashboard ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Do NOT set DASHBOARD_PORT here: the compose service maps host 7071 to the
# container's default 7070, and the healthcheck probes the same var — changing
# it in this file breaks both. Change the HOST port in docker-compose.yml
# ("127.0.0.1:<host>:7070") if 7071 clashes.

# ── Voting power (read this) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Robinhood has NO on-chain staking: voting power is mirrored from this wallet's
# Base veREPPO position. Lock on Base (your Base node's stake config does this),
# then sync manually at https://robinhood.reppo.ai — re-sync after changing the
# Base lock (~10 min rate limit). The node skips its lock setup on robinhood.
